/T (This project presents a complete residential building design developed using AutoCAD 2024, featuring carefully planned layouts for the ground floor, typical residential floors, garage, and rooftop. The typical residential floor consists of multiple well-planned units arranged around a central staircase and circulation area. Each unit is designed to provide comfort and functionality, incorporating spacious bedrooms, a kitchen, two toilets, and a combined living and dining space with proper access and ventilation.)
/E (This project presents a complete residential building design developed using AutoCAD 2024, featuring carefully planned layouts for the ground floor, typical residential floors, garage, and rooftop. The typical residential floor consists of multiple well-planned units arranged around a central staircase and circulation area. Each unit is designed to provide comfort and functionality, incorporating spacious bedrooms, a kitchen, two toilets, and a combined living and dining space with proper access and ventilation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
