/E (The ground floor is primarily designed for parking and essential building services. It provides dedicated car parking spaces on both sides, along with a generator room, guard room, service/toilet facilities, and a centrally positioned staircase and platform for convenient vertical circulation. The layout ensures efficient use of the available space while maintaining clear movement and accessibility.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
